{"availability":"available","full":"Axellum/M5-Tab5-ESPHome-LVGL","name":"M5-Tab5-ESPHome-LVGL","description":"Home Assistant wall screen for the M5Stack Tab5 (ESP32-P4), built with ESPHome and LVGL. Home Assistant pushes, the tablet never polls. Screen in 7 languages (FR, EN, DE, NL, ES, IT, TR). Local wake word, weather, climate, rooms of devices, plants, 8 offline games. Web installer. Made with AI.","category":"Developer tools","language":"C++","stars":12,"forks":0,"created":"2026-05-16T19:28:38Z","updated":"2026-10-18T10:40:28Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://axellum.github.io/M5-Tab5-ESPHome-LVGL/","topics":["esp-web-tools","esp32","esp32-p4","esphome","hmi","home-assistant","home-assistant-dashboard","home-automation","homeassistant","iot","lvgl","lvgl9","m5stack","m5stack-tab5","meteo-france","multilingual","smart-home","touch-screen","voice-assistant","wall-panel"],"demo":"https://axellum.github.io/M5-Tab5-ESPHome-LVGL/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T11:30:02.244Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T11:30:02.244Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T11:30:02.244Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T03:37:49.472Z","stars":10,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-12T06:28:03.508Z","stars":11,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-18T11:30:02.244Z","stars":12,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["[]( []( []( []( [](LICENSE) [](docs/relatedprojects.md)","This page is also the home page of the website, with a menu, a search and every page in English or French: axellum.github.io/M5-Tab5-ESPHome-LVGL."],"features":["Push-only, zero polling. Home Assistant sends only what changed; the tablet never asks for anything (ADR-0001).","Voice starts on the device. \"Okay Nabu\" and a \"Stop\" word for the roller shutter are detected on the tablet; audio leaves it only after the wake word.","Seven languages, down to the details. French, English, German, Dutch, Spanish, Italian and Turkish, switched from Home Assistant: menus, games, dates, the texts Home Assistant sends and the spoken alarm briefing.…","Twenty-one themes, light or dark. Colours, shapes and the fonts of the clock change at once, without a restart, from Home Assistant or the tablet's console; « Auto » turns light at sunrise and dark at sunset (themes).","Keeps working when Home Assistant doesn't. Clock, alarm clock, games and the diagnostics console stay usable on their own."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Axellum/M5-Tab5-ESPHome-LVGL/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"3dc9b276b26726c33a7aa9988605c96283b05e4a46f451c2eb9e681a2d2de8cb","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:49.604Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:49.604Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"[]( []( []( []( [](LICENSE) [](docs/relatedprojects.md)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Axellum/M5-Tab5-ESPHome-LVGL/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"3dc9b276b26726c33a7aa9988605c96283b05e4a46f451c2eb9e681a2d2de8cb","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Axellum/M5-Tab5-ESPHome-LVGL/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:49.605Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T21:50:14Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Axellum/M5-Tab5-ESPHome-LVGL/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:49.608Z","hash":"3dc9b276b26726c33a7aa9988605c96283b05e4a46f451c2eb9e681a2d2de8cb","originalBytes":47539,"storedBytes":47539,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:49.472Z","subjects":["Games & game development","Automation & workflows","Home automation","Chatbots & assistants","Data & dashboards"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Developer tools","subjects":["Games & game development","Automation & workflows","Home automation","Chatbots & assistants","Data & dashboards"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Games & game development","source":"metadata","match":"games"},{"subject":"Automation & workflows","source":"metadata"